OL,3,AUS and China must act as responsible
OL,4,Apowers together, Xi says as Trump
OL,5,Atoasts friendship at state dinner
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump welcomed
OL,8,FChina's President Xi Jinping to the
OL,9,FWhite House for a lavish state dinner
OL,10,Fwhere both leaders touted a new chapter
OL,11,Fin their friendship.
OL,13,FXi said the countries "must act as
OL,14,Fresponsible major countries to meet the
OL,15,Fexpectations of our peoples" while
OL,16,FTrump toasted a future of "harmony,
OL,17,Fpeace and success" for both nations.
OL,19,FWhile both pledged to ensure stability
OL,20,Fbetween them, experts have cautioned
OL,21,FXi's visit is yet to yield obvious
OL,22,Fprogress on pressing issues.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,107,105,200,300,0,100
