OL,3,AUS and China must act as responsible
OL,4,Apowers together, Xi says as Trump
OL,5,Atoasts friendship at state dinner
OL,6,
OL,7,FBillionaire business leaders, Trump
OL,8,Fadministration officials and US tech
OL,9,FCEOs were among the dinner's guests.
OL,10,FTheir arrival was marked, however, by
OL,11,Fprotesters shouting from just outside,
OL,12,Fsome of whom were arrested.
